  "description": "WF-4 SOS orchestrator. Creates or reuses the open sos_event, loads the care circle, mints a doctor share link (fail-open to NA), dispatches templates 10/11/12 in parallel at nudge_index 0, logs every send and skip, and acknowledges the elder.",
